=\"695\">Goede staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"716\">Inclusief doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"824\">⚽ Waarom FIFA World Cup 2006?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"951\">\r\n<li data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"850\">Officiële WK-licentie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"880\">\r\n<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"880\">Speel met nationale teams</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<p data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"918\">Toernooimodus en oefenwedstrijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"951\">\r\n<p data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"951\">Leuk voor lokale multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"973\">🛡 Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1077\">Bij Used Products ontvang je standaard garantie op je aankoop.<br data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1039\">Veilig en vertrouwd tweedehands kopen.</p>",
